<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Optional practice support</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-2/a/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 2 Course Review · Original Paper A</p><h1>Optional practice support</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace for section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or review by your own teacher.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper A</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><section class="box"><p>This optional preparation list is not part of the timed paper. Using it during an attempt changes the support condition.</p><table><tr><th>Chinese</th><th>Pinyin</th><th>Meaning</th></tr><tr><td class="cn">家务</td><td>jiāwù</td><td>housework</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">洗碗</td><td>xǐ wǎn</td><td>wash dishes</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">社区</td><td>shèqū</td><td>community</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">路口</td><td>lùkǒu</td><td>intersection</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">长椅</td><td>chángyǐ</td><td>bench</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">围裙</td><td>wéiqún</td><td>apron</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">清淡</td><td>qīngdàn</td><td>mild, lightly seasoned</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">采购</td><td>cǎigòu</td><td>purchase supplies</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">开放</td><td>kāifàng</td><td>open to visitors</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">账单</td><td>zhàngdān</td><td>bill</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">浇水</td><td>jiāo shuǐ</td><td>water plants</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">平坦</td><td>píngtǎn</td><td>flat, even</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">纸灯</td><td>zhǐdēng</td><td>paper lantern</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">内外</td><td>nèi wài</td><td>inside and outside</td></tr></table></section></main></body></html>